# ✅ Expected Output

✔️ Daylight → LED OFF

✔️ Night → Motion Detection Enabled

✔️ Motion → LED ON at 100% Brightness

✔️ No Motion for 30 Seconds → LED Dimmed to 20%

✔️ All Events Logged to the Serial Monitor with Timestamps

